      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "My rebuttal?  Old school ragtime.  \n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AcZroW6fGcA\n\nTom Brier is a genius.  He sight reads simple melody lines and improvises around them.  That song in the video?  His first time seeing those charts or even hearing that song.  Be sure to watch the whole thing as he gives it a second shot and does ridiculous things.  I've been playing piano for over 20 years and his ability just baffles me.\n\nEven if you don't like ragtime, spend some time looking up Tom Brier videos.  He's freaking amazing.\n\n\nAdditional viewing material: http://youtu.be/wmd1NiVYjEA\nAnd a classic, with some goofiness: http://youtu.be/9DyHFonnu2E",
