    {
      "id": 22130,
      "name": "Christopher",
      "username": "Christopher",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-23T16:34:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok, and one more from Tom Brier, as it shows a close up of the sheet music.</p>\n<div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"Ci1486DNiw8\" data-video-title=\"Legend of Zelda -- ゼルダの伝説 -- Horse Race -- 競馬 piano sight-read by Tom Brier\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ci1486DNiw8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/833948c5ce6ce096e009a3ed2f41edb9fa6a7d80.jpeg\" title=\"Legend of Zelda -- ゼルダの伝説 -- Horse Race -- 競馬 piano sight-read by Tom Brier\" data-dominant-color=\"4A524D\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<p>Any of you who read sheet music know that what he’s playing is being VASTLY improvised on the spot.  By sight.</p>\n<p>Ridiculous.</p>",
