      "id": 22135,
      "name": "Adam",
      "username": "Adam",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-25T19:34:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The only way you could know that is if you, in person, handed him sheet music that you knew as a fact he’d never seen before, and the only way to be 100% certain on that is if you wrote the music yourself. I understand the desire to see the best in things, and even if it’s not fully sight-read, it’s still damn impressive, but the number of different videos of him “blindly” reading the same songs implies it’s more than a little bit staged.</p>\n<p>I also didn’t say he was sloppy, I said all the non-actually-Billy-Joel Root Beer Rags are sloppy, and I’d like to see him do it. For instance:</p><div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"gtT_Mn0PFT8\" data-video-title=\" - YouTube\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gtT_Mn0PFT8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"\" title=\" - YouTube\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n",
