      "raw": "The only way you could know that is if you, in person, handed him sheet music that you knew as a fact he'd never seen before, and the only way to be 100% certain on that is if you wrote the music yourself. I understand the desire to see the best in things, and even if it's not fully sight-read, it's still damn impressive, but the number of different videos of him \"blindly\" reading the same songs implies it's more than a little bit staged. \n\nI also didn't say he was sloppy, I said all the non-actually-Billy-Joel Root Beer Rags are sloppy, and I'd like to see him do it. For instance:\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gtT_Mn0PFT8",
